// As-built notes - written by the VERIFICATION agent when it verifies a spec:
// any deviation from the brief that downstream specs must know (renamed
// modules, changed commands, adjusted signatures). "none" needs no row.
// Rendered into the briefs of every spec that depends on the noted spec, so
// re-render (just specs) after adding rows. Implementation agents never edit this.
// asbuilt spec_010_build { note = "test recipe is `just test`, not cargo test directly." }
